#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Manage Aerial Imagery: Run A Standard Process On Orthophotomosaics"
msgstr "Imágenes aéreas: proceso estándar de ortofotomosaicos"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"This workflow will guide you through applying a standard process to your "
"aerial imaging bands"
msgstr ""
"Este flujo le guiará por el proceso estándar de los canales de imágenes "
"aéreas"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Here you can take one of the imaging event bands you uploaded all the way "
"through the process to plot image saving. This will require manual steps "
"such as image rotation, cropping, and plot polygon templating. After you "
"have completed this process for one imaging event band, you can apply it to "
"all other imaging event bands and other calculated vegetative indices."
msgstr ""
"Aquí puede procesar un canal de un evento de captura hasta guardar imágenes "
"de parcelas. Se requieren pasos manuales de rotación, recorte y creación de "
"plantillas de polígonos. Una vez terminado un canal, puede aplicar el "
"proceso a otros canales e índices vegetativos calculados."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Select a imaging event band"
msgstr "Seleccione un canal del evento de captura"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Please select one imaging event band to take through the process. It is "
"recommended to select a band that has high contrast, such as a NIR band."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione un canal del evento de captura para procesarlo. Se recomienda un "
"canal de alto contraste, como NIR."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Imaging Event Band Name"
msgstr "Nombre del canal del evento de captura"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Band Description"
msgstr "Descripción del canal"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Band Type"
msgstr "Tipo de canal"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Imaging Event Band"
msgstr "Canal del evento de captura"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Use ground control points (GCPs) to automate the entire standard process"
msgstr ""
"Use puntos de control terrestre (GCP) para automatizar todo el proceso "
"estándar"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"If a previous imaging event on this field experiment has already completed "
"the standard process, then that imaging event can be used to automate the "
"rest of the standard process on this new imaging event."
msgstr ""
"Si un evento de captura anterior de este ensayo ya completó el proceso "
"estándar, puede utilizarlo para automatizar el proceso del nuevo evento."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"If ground control points (GCPs) were defined for a previous imaging event, "
"then GCPs can automate the standard process for this new imaging event."
msgstr ""
"Si se definieron puntos de control terrestre (GCP) para un evento anterior, "
"pueden automatizar el proceso estándar del nuevo evento."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Has a previous imaging event on this field trial completed the standard "
"process already?:"
msgstr ""
"¿Un evento de captura anterior de este ensayo ya completó el proceso "
"estándar?:"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Yes, and it has GCPs defined."
msgstr "Sí, y tiene GCP definidos."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Yes, and the same fixed camera rig was used."
msgstr "Sí, y se utilizó el mismo equipo fijo de cámaras."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Select the aerial imaging event to use as a template. The same rotation, "
"cropping, and plot-polygon template will be applied:"
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el evento de captura aérea como plantilla. Se aplicarán la misma "
"rotación, recorte y plantilla de polígonos:"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Skip and Go to Next Step"
msgstr "Omitir y pasar al siguiente paso"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Use GCPs"
msgstr "Usar GCP"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Rotate your selected imaging event band"
msgstr "Gire el canal seleccionado del evento de captura"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Here you can do a rotation of your imaging event image."
msgstr "Aquí puede girar la imagen del evento de captura."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Your image should have precise row-to-row parallel alignment."
msgstr "Las filas de la imagen deben quedar perfectamente paralelas."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Rotate Counter-Clockwise Degrees (Use Left and Right Arrows For Fine Tuning):"
msgstr ""
"Rotación antihoraria en grados (use las flechas izquierda y derecha para "
"ajustar):"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Save Rotated Image And Go To Next Step"
msgstr "Guardar imagen girada y pasar al siguiente paso"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Crop your imaging event band to specific area of interest"
msgstr "Recorte el canal del evento al área de interés"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Here you can do a rough cropping of the stitched ortho image to focus only "
"on the actual field experiment."
msgstr ""
"Aquí puede recortar aproximadamente la ortofoto unida para centrarse en el "
"ensayo de campo."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Click on four points in the image to make a four-sided polygon."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en cuatro puntos de la imagen para dibujar un polígono de cuatro "
"lados."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Only the last polygon that you draw will be used for the cropping."
msgstr "Para el recorte solo se utilizará el último polígono dibujado."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Save and Go to Next Step"
msgstr "Guardar y pasar al siguiente paso"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Previously Used Image Cropping For This Field Trial:"
msgstr "Recorte de imagen utilizado anteriormente para este ensayo:"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Use Image Cropping"
msgstr "Usar recorte de imagen"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Cropping"
msgstr "Recorte"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Threshold your imaging event band to remove background"
msgstr "Aplique un umbral al canal para eliminar el fondo"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Discard Lowest Percent of Pixel Values:"
msgstr "Descartar el porcentaje inferior de valores de píxeles:"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
#, perl-format
msgid "e.g. 10% of lowest pixel values (Min 0, Max 100)"
msgstr ""
"p. ej., 10% obtenido de los valores de píxel más bajos (Mín 0, Máx 100)"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Discard Highest Percent of Pixel Values:"
msgstr "Descartar el porcentaje superior de valores de píxeles:"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
#, perl-format
msgid "e.g. 10% of highest pixel values (Min 0, Max 100)"
msgstr ""
"p. ej., 10% obtenido de los valores de píxel más altos (Mín 0, Máx 100)"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Remove Background Using Percentage Threshold"
msgstr "Eliminar fondo mediante umbral porcentual"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Remove the background by specifying percentage threshold value"
msgstr "Elimine el fondo indicando un umbral porcentual"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Apply Threshold"
msgstr "Aplicar umbral"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Histogram of Pixel Values"
msgstr "Histograma de valores de píxeles"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Histogram of pixel values"
msgstr "Histograma de valores de píxeles"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Denoised Original Image"
msgstr "Imagen original con ruido reducido"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Thresholding"
msgstr "Aplicación de umbral"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Define plot polygons relative to the field layout"
msgstr "Defina los polígonos de parcelas según la distribución del campo"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Clear One Polygon"
msgstr "Borrar un polígono"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Find Distance Between Points"
msgstr "Calcular distancia entre puntos"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Switch Between Original and Background Removed Image"
msgstr "Alternar entre la imagen original y la imagen sin fondo"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Apply these same steps to other imaging event bands in the current imaging "
"event"
msgstr ""
"Aplique estos mismos pasos a otros canales del evento de captura actual"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Here you can apply the same actions you did for the previous steps 1 to 6, "
"to additional imaging event bands in this imaging event."
msgstr ""
"Aquí puede aplicar las acciones de los pasos anteriores 1 a 6 a otros "
"canales de este evento de captura."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Apply same standard process to all uploaded imaging events that use the same "
"camera rig:"
msgstr ""
"Aplicar el mismo proceso estándar a todos los eventos cargados con el mismo "
"equipo de cámaras:"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid "Manage Aerial Imagery: Save Ground Control Points"
msgstr "Imágenes aéreas: guardar puntos de control terrestre"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"Please click and save at least three points. The names of the GCPs MUST be "
"consistent across imaging events!."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione y guarde al menos tres puntos. ¡Los nombres de los GCP DEBEN ser "
"coherentes entre eventos de captura!."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"You can move to different images (e.g. blue, green, red, NIR, BGR) which are "
"available after the standard process has been completed."
msgstr ""
"Puede alternar entre imágenes (por ejemplo blue, green, red, NIR, BGR) "
"disponibles después del proceso estándar."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
