msgstr "{column}: Campo opcional. El formato permitido es: {format}."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/upload_nirs_spreadsheet_dialogs.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"{column}: Required field that matches with existing data in the database. It "
"can be the plot name, subplots, plant name, or tissue sample, depending how "
