#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"{span}SecreTary{end_span} is for prediction of signal peptides from the "
"amino acid sequence of a protein."
msgstr ""
"{span}SecreTary{end_span} sirve para predecir péptidos señal a partir de la "
"secuencia de aminoácidos de una proteína."

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"{span}SecreTary{end_span} is mainly trained and tested on the plant "
"secretome that has been identified through functional screens including a "
"yeast secretion trap."
msgstr ""
"{span}SecreTary{end_span} se ha entrenado y probado principalmente con el "
"secretoma vegetal identificado mediante cribados funcionales, incluida una "
"trampa de secreción en levadura."

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"The amino acid sequences can be input by pasting one or more protein "
"sequences, in {bold}FASTA format{end_bold} into the {span}"
"SecreTary{end_span} input page."
msgstr ""
"Las secuencias de aminoácidos pueden introducirse pegando una o más "
"secuencias de proteínas en {bold}formato FASTA{end_bold} en la página de "
"entrada de {span}SecreTary{end_span}."

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"{span}SecreTary{end_span} analyses proteins at a rate of approximate 80/"
"second."
msgstr ""
"{span}SecreTary{end_span} analiza proteínas a una velocidad aproximada de 80 "
"por segundo."

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
msgid "An example:"
msgstr "Un ejemplo:"

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
msgid "1. Input Sequences"
msgstr "1. Secuencias de entrada"

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Paste the sequence(s) into the window, or click browse to select a fasta "
"file on your disk for analysis. Then, click on the \"Submit\" button. Expect "
"to wait about 10-15 seconds to see the results of analyzing 1000 sequences."
msgstr ""
"Pegue las secuencias en la ventana o haga clic en Examinar para seleccionar "
"en su disco un archivo fasta para el análisis. Luego haga clic en el botón "
"\"Enviar\". Los resultados del análisis de 1000 secuencias tardan entre 10 y "
"15 segundos aproximadamente."

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
msgid "2. Submission"
msgstr "2. Envío"

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"For each sequence {span}SecreTary{end_span} gives a score; sequences with "
"scores greater than or equal to 0.75 are predicted to have a signal peptide."
msgstr ""
"Para cada secuencia, {span}SecreTary{end_span} proporciona una puntuación; "
"se predice que las secuencias con puntuaciones mayores o iguales a 0.75 "
"tienen un péptido señal."

