#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
msgid "SOL-100 Organisms"
msgstr "Organismos SOL-100"

#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"The International SOL Genome Project (SOL) is a \"virtual umbrella\" "
"organization for promoting, coordinating and actively seeking additional "
"scientists, countries and funding agencies to participate in an expedition "
"to understand, utilize and conserve natural biodiversity (see {link}{address}"
"{end_link})."
msgstr ""
"El Proyecto Internacional del Genoma SOL (SOL) es una organización «paraguas "
"virtual» que promueve y coordina la participación de más científicos, países "
"y organismos financiadores en una iniciativa para comprender, utilizar y "
"conservar la biodiversidad natural (véase {link}{address}{end_link})."

#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"SOL includes scientists from more than 30 countries that are united and "
"excited about the sustainable and equitable use of natural biodiversity in "
"biological research, plant breeding and conservation of these resources for "
"the future."
msgstr ""
"SOL reúne a científicos de más de 30 países, unidos por su interés en el uso "
"sostenible y equitativo de la biodiversidad natural en la investigación "
"biológica y el mejoramiento vegetal, y en la conservación de estos recursos "
"para el futuro."

#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"The SOL community has sequenced both the tomato genome and the potato genome "
"through grants from national funding agencies as well as international "
"collaborative projects."
msgstr ""
"La comunidad SOL ha secuenciado los genomas del tomate y de la papa mediante "
"subvenciones de organismos nacionales y proyectos de colaboración "
"internacional."

#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
msgid "Who are we?"
msgstr "¿Quiénes somos?"

#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
msgid ""
"If you are sequencing a SOL-100 genome, please submit the genome to SGN."
msgstr "Si está secuenciando un genoma SOL-100, envíelo a SGN."

#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"{bold}Submission to SGN requires prior submission to {link}Genbank{end_link}"
"{end_bold} and a {bold}{link2}Genbank Project ID{end_link2}{end_bold}. "
"Please contact {link3}{person}{end_link3} at Genbank or {link4}"
"SGN{end_link4} for more information."
msgstr ""
"{bold}El envío a SGN requiere el envío previo a {link}Genbank{end_link}"
"{end_bold} y un {bold}{link2}ID de proyecto de Genbank{end_link2}{end_bold}. "
"Para más información, contacte con {link3}{person}{end_link3} en Genbank o "
"con {link4}SGN{end_link4}."

#: mason/sequencing/sol100.mas
msgid "Submit genome to SGN"
msgstr "Enviar genoma a SGN"

